        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/CoastalTown/_scene_octopus.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository c823beec-3d73-47b6-87d9-076c384c4662).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning, 47. The Board has asked us to eliminate two targets in Sapienza: Padre Francesco, a Catholic priest, and Benvenuto Lucchese, an unassuming politician. Apparently, the two of them are planning to meet this evening to discuss how they can scratch each other&apos;s backs. Our client, a lawyer who despises corruption, has paid us to ensure that this meeting will never happen. I will leave you to prepare. \r\r(Contract used for The Bells are Ringing and Get What You Wish For Challenges.)",
